  "body": "Mechanical conversion of `k8s/` to a leaf Helm chart, matching the org-wide pattern set in [auth#11](https://github.com/nelsong6/auth/pull/11). Same shape and the same CI swap (kustomize install + edit → sed on values.yaml).\n\n`helm template kill-me k8s/` renders cleanly with the current image tag (`f02f97a`); ArgoCD's first sync under Helm should be a no-op diff.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
